# Lost Jitte is charged on turn 3 by its equipped Basking Rootwalla; Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills that Rootwalla on turn
# 4, leaving the Jitte unattached with a charge. On turn 5 Bot1 removes the charge for "put a +1/+1 counter on equipped
# creature": there is no equipped creature, so the other Rootwalla (never equipped) gets nothing; the cost was still paid.

